Subject: [PATCH] Preload Basic 1-6 + Kindergarten curriculum from official
 NaCCA guides

All 17 primary-level guide PDFs extracted to 100% code-level recall
(extractor v6: presence-verified code fixup, fused/split print recovery,
column re-anchoring on geometry-shift pages, header-cell heading prefixes,
figure-label guards).

Data shape mirrors the JHS design: per-(strand, level) entries with
levels: ['Basic N'] so the app shows exactly the strands for the
selected class (sub-strand headings are re-printed with different
wording in each level section and printed sub-strand numbers are
unreliable, so level-accurate names are kept per level).

Subjects rebuilt: Mathematics, Science, English, Computing (B4-6),
Creative Arts (B4-6), History, RME, OWOP, Ghanaian Language, PHE,
French (B4-6), Kindergarten (KG 1-2). Official print typos repaired
at build time (per-file scoped: B4.1.1.3.2 in the lower-primary maths
guide is a typo of B3.1.1.3.2 while B4.1.1.3.2 in the upper-primary
guide is the real HCF indicator; math B6.5.2.2 = B6.4.1.2.2; science
B1.4.1.2.2 = B5.4.1.2.2; KG K16.2.1.2 = K1.6.2.1.2, K2.6.61.3 =
K2.6.6.1.3; GHL B4.1.2.1.1 = B4.1.3.1.1).

Verified: tsc clean, vite build green, runtime smoke (2051 stds /
4265 inds across all 14 subjects incl. JHS: no duplicate codes, every
indicator under its own standard, per-level entries well-formed).
